# The image only needs README.md, MANIFEST.in, setup.py, requirements*.txt, src/
# and docs/ (MANIFEST.in references it).  The rest of the repository is mounted at
# run time, so shipping it into the build context only slows the build down --
# tests/firmware alone is several megabytes of prebuilt images.
.git
.github
tests
examples
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
build
dist
*.egg-info
*.log
